571
00:28:02,380 --> 00:28:04,480
Not preparing properly.

572
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,880
Even with AI?

573
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:10,720
Yes, AI can help, but you still need to understand the topic.

574
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:12,720
That's a very good point.

575
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:16,700
Another mistake is using AI without clear instructions.

576
00:28:16,700 --> 00:28:18,100
