participants can focus on the discussion.

703
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:49,960
Can you give an example of how that works?

704
00:33:49,960 --> 00:33:50,560
Sure.

705
00:33:50,560 --> 00:33:52,400
During a recent project meeting,

706
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:54,920
the AI tool recorded the conversation

707
00:33:54,920 --> 00:33:58,040
and created a summary that included key decisions,

