737
00:35:41,420 --> 00:35:44,300
That must have saved a lot of preparation time.

738
00:35:44,300 --> 00:35:48,140
It did. It also helped us organize our ideas more clearly.

739
00:35:48,140 --> 00:35:50,460
Now, let's talk about after the meeting.

