748
00:36:19,100 --> 00:36:20,700
Can you give an example?

749
00:36:20,700 --> 00:36:27,740
Sure. After a meeting, I might input key points into AI and ask it to write a professional follow-up email.

750
00:36:27,740 --> 00:36:29,660
