760
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,520
That could be risky.

761
00:36:52,520 --> 00:36:53,360
Exactly.

762
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:55,920
It's important to use AI as a tool,

763
00:36:55,920 --> 00:36:58,260
not a replacement for human thinking.

764
00:36:58,260 --> 00:36:59,600
Any other challenges?

765
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:01,920
Data privacy is another concern.

766
